.. function:: max(input, dim, keepdim=False, *, out=None) -> (Tensor, LongTensor)
   :noindex:

Returns a namedtuple ``(values, indices)`` where ``values`` is the maximum
value of each row of the :attr:`input` tensor in the given dimension
