Returns the maximum value of all elements in the ``input`` tensor.

.. warning::
    This function produces deterministic (sub)gradients unlike ``max(dim=0)``

Args:
    input (Tensor): the input tensor.

Example::

    >>> a = torch.randn(1, 3)
